sequenceDiagram
    participant Builder
    participant Hasher
    participant Merkle
    participant Runtime

    Builder->>Hasher: stream asset data
    Hasher-->>Builder: BLAKE3 digest
    Builder->>Merkle: insert leaf(digest)
    Merkle-->>Builder: updated root
    Builder->>Runtime: emit bundle (header + root)
    Runtime->>Hasher: verify chunk digest on load
    Runtime->>Merkle: reconstruct path (optional)
    Runtime-->>Runtime: cache verified chunks
